# core/domain

- Pure TypeScript only. **No** Angular, RxJS, NgRx, TanStack, UI, Capacitor, Sentry.
- May depend only on `@senbilan/shared/util` (and itself).
- Export through `src/index.ts` → `@senbilan/core/domain`.
- Prefer immutable types, branded IDs, `Result` for fallible ops.
- Business rules and status transitions live here — not in components.
- Tests: Vitest node env, table-driven; no TestBed.
- File names: `*.entity.ts`, `*.value-object.ts`, `*.errors.ts`, `*.policy.ts`.
